<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ ADRs mixed in late New York, Dow up 39 points.</title>
<headline>NZ ADRs mixed in late New York, Dow up 39 points.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>New Zealand ADRs were mixed in late New York trade, where the Dow Industrials were 39.63 points higher at 7,040.52 at 8.00 a.m. NZT.</p>
<p>Price movements of NZ stocks listed in the U.S., Britain and</p>
<p>Australia.</p>
<p>Company	  Exchange    Last	  Net change</p>
<p>FCL Bldg	 N.Y.    US$28 3/4	 -0 1/4 *</p>
<p>FCL Engy	 N.Y.    US$27 3/8	 +0 1/4 *</p>
<p>FCL Paper	N.Y.    US$21 3/8	 +0 3/8 *</p>
<p>FCL Forest     N.Y.    US$13 7/8	 -0 3/8 *</p>
<p>Telecom	  N.Y.    US$73 5/8	 -1 1/4 *</p>
<p>Tranz Rail     N.Y.    US$18 1/8	 +0 1/4 *</p>
<p>Thistle	  London  185 1/2	   nil</p>
<p>Guinness Peat  London  36		  -0 1/2</p>
<p>NZ IT	    London  untraded</p>
<p>Foreign &amp; Col  London  163 1/2	   +1 1/4</p>
<p>Templeton	London  149 1/4	   -0 1/4</p>
<p>Lion	     Sydney  A$3.21	    -3</p>
<p>Goodman	  Sydney  A$1.69	    +6</p>
<p>Macraes	  Sydney  A$2.31	    -5</p>
<p>Notes - In New York, Telecom's American Depository Receipts are traded in bundles of 16 shares, while both the Fletcher Challenge shares are in bundles of 10 each. Tranz Rail ADSs are groups of three ordinary shares.</p>
<p>- London prices are mid-rates.</p>
<p>- Asterisk * means stock is still trading</p>
<p>-- Wellington Newsroom 64 4 4734 746</p>
</text>
